Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}Machine learning promises to accelerate therapeutic antibody design,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.87,0:00:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}but only if models can accurately read the sequence-to-function fitness landscape.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.15,0:00:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}This paper introduces FLAb, the Fitness Landscape for Antibodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.33,0:00:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}the largest therapeutic antibody benchmark to date.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.61,0:00:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}It gathers experimental measurements for six developability properties and uses them to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.21,0:00:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}stress-test six widely used deep learning protein models against physics-based Rosetta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.81,0:00:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}The headline finding is sobering: no single model correlates well with all six properties,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.60,0:00:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}and performance swings sharply across datasets of the same property,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.97,0:00:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}revealing how far the field still has to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}Machine learning can only speed up antibody design if models truly understand what makes an antibody good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.95,0:00:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}Yet the major protein fitness benchmarks, like CAFA, TAPE, and FLIP,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.35,0:00:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}either leave antibody data out entirely or include only a sliver of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.94,0:01:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}That leaves researchers with no principled way to check whether a deep learning model
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.44,0:01:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}actually captures antibody fitness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.70,0:01:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}Today the field often falls back on weak proxies such as native sequence recovery,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.01,0:01:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}which say little about real therapeutic potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}A therapeutic antibody has to satisfy many demands at once: it must express well,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.87,0:01:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}stay stable, avoid triggering an immune response, bind its target tightly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.74,0:01:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}resist aggregation, and steer clear of sticking to the wrong things.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.21,0:01:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}These properties often pull against each other, so improving one can hurt another.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.61,0:01:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}If a model could reliably score candidates across all of these axes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.08,0:01:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}it could replace slow and expensive wet-lab screening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.63,0:01:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}As new antibody design methods keep appearing, the field needs one shared,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.50,0:01:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}antibody-focused benchmark to judge them fairly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.96,0:01:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}To fill this gap, the authors build FLAb, the Fitness Landscape for Antibodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.13,0:02:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}the largest therapeutic antibody design benchmark assembled so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.52,0:02:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}It curates seventeen mutational landscapes with more than thirteen thousand experimental fitness measurements,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.72,0:02:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}spanning six developability properties.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.27,0:02:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}Using this benchmark,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.64,0:02:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}they evaluate six widely adopted pretrained protein models and compare them to physics-based Rosetta.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.25,0:02:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}Just as importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.56,0:02:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}all of the FLAb data are released openly so the community can keep expanding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.10,0:02:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}The core idea is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.66,0:02:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}Every antibody sequence, or its structure, is fed to a model,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.63,0:02:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}and the model reports a perplexity score averaged over all residues in the heavy and light chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}Perplexity measures how surprised the model is by the sequence,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.09,0:02:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}so a well-behaved model should be confident, meaning low perplexity,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.51,0:02:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}about high-fitness antibodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.46,0:02:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}The authors then correlate these scores against real experimental fitness using three
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.99,0:02:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}coefficients: Pearson for linear trends,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.59,0:02:60.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}Spearman for monotonic trends, and Kendall tau for ordinal agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}Crucially, the models are used exactly as released, with no additional fine-tuning,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.47,0:03:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}across decoder-only, encoder-only, and inverse-folding architectures.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.26,0:03:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}FLAb pulls together seventeen mutational landscapes from distinct antibody families,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.64,0:03:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}drawn from eight separate studies,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.82,0:03:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}adding up to more than thirteen thousand fitness measurements.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.79,0:03:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}Together they cover the six developability properties that define a therapeutic antibody: expression,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.26,0:03:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}thermostability, immunogenicity, aggregation, polyreactivity, and binding affinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.58,0:03:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}Each property is grounded in its own real experimental unit,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.42,0:03:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}from micrograms per milliliter for expression to melting temperature for stability and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.93,0:03:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}dissociation constants for binding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.18,0:03:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}This diversity is what lets FLAb test whether a model generalizes across the many facets of antibody fitness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.46,0:03:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}The headline result is a reality check.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.30,0:04:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}No model correlates well with all six properties, and even for a single property,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.15,0:04:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}performance swings widely from one dataset to another.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.99,0:04:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}ProGen2-Small was the most frequent winner, coming out on top for seven datasets,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.84,0:04:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}while ProGen2-Medium, ProGen2-OAS, ESM-IF,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.68,0:04:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}and Rosetta energy tied just behind at six each.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.53,0:04:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}Notably,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.37,0:04:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}sequence-based models on average beat structure-based ones across every landscape,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.22,0:04:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}with the biggest gap on thermostability,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.06,0:04:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}suggesting that raw sequence signal still carries most of the predictive power here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.21,0:04:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}Digging into what drives performance,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.62,0:04:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}the authors find that parameter count matters more than architecture or training data.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.23,0:04:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}Encoder-only AntiBERTy and decoder-only IgLM,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.17,0:04:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}both trained on the same five hundred fifty eight million antibody sequences,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.19,0:04:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}behave almost identically.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.89,0:04:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}Scaling ProGen2 from one hundred fifty million up to over six billion parameters helped only two properties,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.94,0:04:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}polyreactivity and thermostability.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.22,0:05:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}They also uncover an evolutionary bias: several language models rank the wild-type golimumab
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.22,0:05:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}antibody as fitter than mutants that are actually more thermostable,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.66,0:05:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}while physics-based Rosetta gets the ranking right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.98,0:05:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}It's a reminder that evolutionary likelihood and physical fitness are not the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.09,0:05:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}A few numbers capture the scope and the findings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.30,0:05:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}FLAb spans thirteen thousand three hundred eighty four fitness measurements across seventeen
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.31,0:05:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}mutational landscapes and six developability properties,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.98,0:05:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}testing six deep learning models against Rosetta.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.18,0:05:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}Intrinsic properties, the ones driven by the antibody itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.17,0:05:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}reach an average absolute correlation above zero point six,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.03,0:05:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}while extrinsic properties lag well behind, with binding under zero point four,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}expression under zero point four two, and immunogenicity under zero point five.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.37,0:05:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}And models are far better at telling apart mutants within one family,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.88,0:06:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}at zero point seven seven, than across different families,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.67,0:06:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}at just zero point one two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.74,0:06:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}The takeaway is honest and useful: no current deep learning model reliably predicts antibody
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.39,0:06:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}fitness across all developability properties,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.15,0:06:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}so we are not yet at the point of trusting these models to filter therapeutic candidates on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.41,0:06:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}The good news is that intrinsic properties are already captured reasonably well,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.32,0:06:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}which points toward the hardest remaining challenges.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.57,0:06:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}The authors argue the most promising path forward is to enrich these models with structural information,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.96,0:06:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}antigen context, and physics-based priors,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.54,0:06:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}and to keep growing open antibody fitness datasets like FLAb.
